==Description==
'''v2.2.0''' is the one hundred and forty-sixth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 3rd of July 2026. This update was meant to be the update which added in the [[Beach Crate]], [[Scuba Ops Crate]] and [[Patriotic Crate]], however, due to a mistake, all three alongside most of the content in this update was accidentally introduced in [[v2.1.0|v2.1.7]].

This update encompassed seven versions, the main v2.2.0 update (released 3 July 2026) and six minor updates, the v2.2.1 (released 3 July 2026), v2.2.1a (released 5 July 2026), v2.2.2 (released 8 July 2026), v2.2.3 (released 13 July 2026), v2.2.4 (released 14 July 2026) and v2.2.5 (released 17 July 2026).

==Changes & Bugfixes==
*''🇺🇸 Rise for the Pledge!'' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]] is now available again.
*[[Commando]] is now purchasable for {{Robux|799}}.
*[[Frost Blaster]] is now purchasable for {{Robux|699}}.
*[[Beach Crate]], [[Scuba Ops Crate]] and [[Patriotic Crate]] are now on sale again.
*[[Beach Crate]], [[Scuba Ops Crate]] and [[Patriotic Crate]] can now be obtained through [[Fallen Mode|Fallen]], [[Frost Mode|Frost]], [[Hardcore Mode|Hardcore]] and [[Voidcore Mode|Voidcore]] mode triumphs.
*Fixed [[Pursuit]] firerate being slower than intended.
*Fixed {{Color|Beach|Anemone}} skin not having a model, making the tower impossible to place down.
*Fixed [[Beach Crate]], [[Scuba Ops Crate]] and [[Patriotic Crate]] not having a robux cost.

:In '''v2.2.1''':
*Partially fixed issues with ''🇺🇸 Rise for the Pledge!'' not progressing.

:In '''v2.2.1a''':
*Fixed {{Color|Beach|Pool Day}} [[Hacker]] drone sounds not playing.
*Fixed most {{Color|Patriotic}} [[Pursuit]] sounds not playing.

:In '''v2.2.2''':
*A board with [[Spin Wheel]] chances and every item for each category now appears next to the [[Spin Wheel]] for players affected by gambling restrictions.
*[[Spin Wheel]] now in most cases no longer rounds down the percentage at all times, it will now round them up or down.

:In '''v2.2.3''':
*When purchasing spin tickets, a button is now visible that when pressed opens up a screen with all the [[Spin Wheel]] items, the odds of getting them and what items are currently on the wheel for players affected by gambling restrictions.
*Spin tickets now appear in the [[Robux Shop]] for players affected by gambling restrictions.
*Fixed {{Color|Beach}} [[Electroshocker]] animations.

:In '''v2.2.4''':
*''🇺🇸 Rise for the Pledge!'' [[Mission Quests|Mission Quest]] is no longer available.
*Removed the updated [[War Machine]] model from the game, as it was accidentally added in '''v2.2.3'''.

:In '''v2.2.5''':
*Crates can no longer be bought if the player has every skin in the crate.
*The odds board previously only available to players affected by gambling restrictions is now visible to regular players.
*{{SpinTicket|Spin Ticket}} odds button previously only available to players affected by gambling restrictions is now visible to regular players.
*[[Spin Wheel]] no longer appears to players affected by gambling restrictions.
*[[Daily Store]] no longer sells crates to players affected by gambling restrictions.
*Majority of crates no longer appear in the inventory of players affected by gambling restrictions.

